; gains more Elemental DMG during longer on-field windows. Passive is weaker in quickswap teams."},{"name":"Kagura's Verity","text":"High CRIT DMG and useful Skill damage; stronger when multiple Jade Screen casts build passive stacks. More effective with C2 and longer rotations."},{"name":"Skyward Atlas","text":"High Base ATK, ATK% and unconditional Elemental DMG make it a reliable choice. Especially useful without large external ATK buffs."},{"name":"Memory of Dust","text":"Large ATK bonuses when shielded; pairs naturally with Zhongli or reliable Crystallize shields. Requires sustained shield uptime."},{"name":"Solar Pearl","text":"CRIT Rate plus Skill/Burst bonuses after Normal Attacks. Does not buff Charged Attacks."},{"name":"The Widsith","text":"Strong CRIT DMG and occasional burst windows, but the random EM buff provides little value. Short field time can favor its cooldown timing."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"Craftable ATK% catalyst with Elemental DMG bonuses after Skill use once its Bond of Life is cleared. Needs effective healing to clear Bond of Life."},{"name":"Dodoco Tales","text":"Free event catalyst supporting Charged Attack damage after Normal Attacks. Only available to players who obtained the past event weapon."}],"a":[{"names":["Nighttime Whispers in the Echoing Woods"],"text":"Best general DPS choice with shield uptime: Skill use and Crystallize shielding boost Geo DMG.","stats":"ATK% / Geo DMG / CRIT"},{"names":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"text":"Strong with Furina: HP changes grant up to 36% CRIT Rate; avoid overcapping CRIT.","stats":"ATK% / Geo DMG / CRIT DMG"},{"names":["Archaic Petra","Gladiator's Finale"],"text":"Straightforward Geo DMG and ATK bonuses without shield or HP-change requirements.","stats":"ATK% / Geo DMG / CRIT"}],"t":[{"name":"Jade Chamber Elite","members":["Ningguang","Chiori","Nicole","Fischl"],"text":"Nicole shields and buffs ATK, Chiori adds off-field Geo damage, and Fischl supplies Electro damage for Crystallize and extra DPS.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Shield","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Golden Fireworks","members":["Ningguang","Zhongli","Bennett","Xiangling"],"text":"Zhongli protects and shreds RES, Bennett boosts ATK, and Xiangling adds Pyro damage and Pyro Resonance.","roles":["Main DPS","Shield","Buffer","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Gemstone Tide","members":["Ningguang","Furina","Yelan","Xilonen"],"text":"Furina and Yelan add strong Hydro damage and buffs, while Xilonen heals and shreds RES. Ningguang drives the team.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Sub DPS","Healer"]},{"name":"Budget Brilliance","members":["Ningguang","Kachina","Bennett","Fischl"],"text":"Kachina enables Geo Resonance and Scroll buffs, Bennett heals and buffs ATK, and Fischl adds off-field damage.","roles":["Main DPS","Sub DPS","Healer","Sub DPS"]}],"v":"Quickswap DPS: Prioritize Burst damage and short rotations; Lost Prayer loses value when Ningguang swaps out frequently.\nFurina Teams: Marechaussee Hunter becomes strong with consistent HP changes. Adjust CRIT Rate to avoid overcapping.\nC2 Rotation: Jade Screen resets when shattered, but Geo particles have a separate 6s cooldown; space casts for energy.\nShield Uptime: Nighttime Whispers and Memory of Dust need reliable shields; Zhongli is ideal, while Crystallize can work.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Main DPS"],"about":"Ningguang is an ATK scaling Geo DPS who deals ranged single target damage through Charged Attacks, Jade Screen, and her Burst. She excels in flexible quickswap teams and benefits greatly from Geo Resonance and shielding.","pros":["Strong single-target damage","Flexible rotations","Low-cost Burst","Geo Resonance synergy"],"cons":["Limited AoE damage","Wants ATK buffs","Projectiles can miss","Shield-dependent sets"],"weapons":["Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","Kagura's Verity","Skyward Atlas","Memory of Dust","Solar Pearl","The Widsith","Flowing Purity","Dodoco Tales"],"arts":[{"sets":["Nighttime Whispers in the Echoing Woods"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best Overall"},{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"With Furina"},{"sets":["Archaic Petra","Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Flexible Alt"}],"main":["ATK%","Geo DMG Bonus","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["ATK: 1,800 - 2,200","Crit Rate: 65% - 75%","Crit DMG: 130% - 180%","Energy Recharge: 110% - 140%"],"vars":[{"title":"On-field Geo Carry","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","Memory of Dust","Solar Pearl"],"arts":[{"sets":["Nighttime Whispers in the Echoing Woods"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Archaic Petra","Gladiator's Finale"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"ATK% / Geo DMG / CRIT.","teams":"Geo resonance or strong ATK buffers.","when":"Use regular Charged Attacks and Burst damage.","cond":"Shield or Crystallize access improves Nighttime Whispers.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Furina CRIT Setup","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Lost Prayer to the Sacred Winds","Solar Pearl"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Reduce sheet CRIT Rate to account for stacks.","teams":"Furina and reliable team healing.","when":"Marechaussee works as an HP-change alternative.","cond":"Requires consistent HP fluctuation.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Prithiva Topaz Sliver","Prithiva Topaz Fragment","Prithiva Topaz Chunk","Prithiva Topaz Gemstone","Basalt Pillar","Teachings of Prosperity","Guide to Prosperity","Philosophies of Prosperity","Recruit's Insignia","Sergeant's Insignia","Lieutenant's Insignia","Glaze Lily","Spirit Locket of Boreas","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 8+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Jade Chamber Elite","members":["Ningguang","Chiori","Nicole","Fischl"]},{"name":"Golden Fireworks","members":["Ningguang","Zhongli","Bennett","Xiangling"]},{"name":"Gemstone Tide","members":["Ningguang","Furina","Yelan","Xilonen"]},{"name":"Budget Brilliance","